Subject: [PATCH] Guided Story: Brand Kit products & services as script and
 scene references

- Brand Kit "Products" tab: upload product/service photos with name, kind,
  benefit and display mode (in scene / exact card); a one-time vision
  description of each photo is saved and retryable
- Guided Story setup picks up to 4 products with Featured or Subtle
  promotion; selections are frozen into the draft with image hashes
- Script planner receives a product brief and tags scenes with productIds
  (max 2); review UI toggles them per scene; featured-without-product warns
- Wan 3.0 reference-to-video attaches product photos (plus the approved
  backdrop so @Image labels align); other models get text descriptions;
  exact-mode products are composited as a product card per scene
- Enqueue and render verify product image hashes before paid work
- OpenAPI + regenerated clients, tests, GUIDED_STORY_PRODUCTS_SETUP.md

